$\l v e r t6 times 22 -14 times 10 |=8$，$\l v e r t4 times 20 -16 times 12 |=112$，$\l v e r t8 times 24 -12 times 8 |=96$，$\l v e r t14 times 30 -6 times 2 |=408$. 最大值对应阅读量，所以选 D.
